{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：09:11 2026-08-12 HKT<br/>發佈時間：09:11 2026-08-12 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：09:11 2026-08-12 HKT</p><p>今日（12日）早上8時33分，警方接獲多個報案，指西貢布袋澳一號及二號魚排起火，並傳出爆炸聲，其間一名60多歲男子救火時手指受傷。消防到場，出動兩喉兩煙帽隊救火，至早上9時22分將火救熄。</p><p>現場所見，消防船在魚排對開海面，不斷向魚排射水，救火期間警方協助封路，以便救援。事件中受傷男子拒絕送院，火警原因有待調查。</p><img alt=\"消防不斷向魚排射水。梁國峰攝\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f808edd630cb54a3a13a5a18fbc526c4/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_07.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e9238f68778bd48cbb7cf3dcb86eb3e7/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"火警現場是布袋澳1號和2號魚排。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1d425b3c3dfa5c3e0a7d2060242ce197/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d1cbb0831144dc4deb2e06a01b381160/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_06.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ecabc9a955d566f897f40a354df5ed8b/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05_2_.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防出動兩喉兩煙帽隊救火。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afbc75562dbf4599da1e616a7044ccb2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/926fc3086168ef537e40c22d2fe2dec1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_05.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6eccc928530bf7c0967a01fc31a6f645/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04_2_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/918205005d2d544eb57daf3c857fc360/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04_1_.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d799c7f54e438569c14223e3e25a0213/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_42_00.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"警方封路以便救援。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7bffcc73f5057ee9f5aabddf22702f74/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_03.jpeg\"/><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/740dd275a4d0602e9055ac722f87c20d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-12_at_09_39_04.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-12T01:59:51.322551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":239,"images":12,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}